      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/9/a90678b65e7ff4c9c1a3f033ab626a1752e82da0.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a90678b65e7ff4c9c1a3f033ab626a1752e82da0\" title=\"1000219272\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/9/a90678b65e7ff4c9c1a3f033ab626a1752e82da0_2_690x353.jpeg\" alt=\"1000219272\" data-base62-sha1=\"o7gyzNIKwV0GkrqFmnPDBqUKFH2\" width=\"690\" height=\"353\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/9/a90678b65e7ff4c9c1a3f033ab626a1752e82da0_2_690x353.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/9/a90678b65e7ff4c9c1a3f033ab626a1752e82da0.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/9/a90678b65e7ff4c9c1a3f033ab626a1752e82da0.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E1D1C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">1000219272</span><span class=\"informations\">1025×525 83.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Maybe something is broken in ur system?</p>",
