      "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:23:31.534Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ahsantareen\">@ahsantareen</a>. Try it out for yourself. It works in my case and moreover it being related to “Item Price Settings” clearly tells us that its meant for selling/buying transactions. I think you have misunderstood the issue.</p>",
