    {
      "id": 480064,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-09-06T16:02:07.590Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/prana\">@Prana</a></p>\n<p>There are two check boxes in accounts setting under Item Prices Setting and I am particularly talking about second one as highlighted below;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/6/e66649c1baf0aba0b7aeee98b864b38161478edc.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e66649c1baf0aba0b7aeee98b864b38161478edc\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/6/e66649c1baf0aba0b7aeee98b864b38161478edc_2_690x327.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wScY6ECx0f74mNnZ1J0NoZzFZJW\" width=\"690\" height=\"327\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/6/e66649c1baf0aba0b7aeee98b864b38161478edc_2_690x327.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/6/e66649c1baf0aba0b7aeee98b864b38161478edc_2_1035x490.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/6/e66649c1baf0aba0b7aeee98b864b38161478edc_2_1380x654.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF8F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1905×903 81.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>When you sell an item from Company A to Company B (both companies belong to the same parent group), ERPNext will use the original valuation rate (cost) from Company A for the transfer. This ensures that Company B does not revalue the item at a different cost, avoiding double profit recognition or inflated costs. Essentially, it carries forward the exact valuation rate instead of calculating a new rate based on Company B’s pricing rules or stock valuation method <strong>due to the fact that valuation rate is being tabulated for a stock item under a warehouse within same company only.</strong></p>\n<p>This Post has a subject and it says <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/valuation-rate-for-internal-customer-and-supplier/110660\">Valuation rate for internal Customer and Supplier</a> requires to discuss valuation rate in internal transaction environment.</p>\n<p>I was not referring to first check box where it is clear item prices bring controlled in case of purchase order in company A will land sales Order in company B with same item rate only. Any change will throw a message as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/4/a4f90dae1e151096b82c64702bddcd8e2b6e57f5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a4f90dae1e151096b82c64702bddcd8e2b6e57f5\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a4f90dae1e151096b82c64702bddcd8e2b6e57f5_2_690x285.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nxpTMnQaqXvJ9vGEJWLVxT1r9A1\" width=\"690\" height=\"285\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a4f90dae1e151096b82c64702bddcd8e2b6e57f5_2_690x285.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a4f90dae1e151096b82c64702bddcd8e2b6e57f5_2_1035x427.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a4f90dae1e151096b82c64702bddcd8e2b6e57f5_2_1380x570.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"757373\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1851×766 56.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
